  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "專題導向設計",
    "sub_ename": "THEMATICALLY ORIENTED·DESIGN",
    "describe_ch": "本課程以專題導向學習(以下簡稱PBL)的教學方式為基礎，強調專案導向做為學習主軸，在實踐過程中直接找到對應的知識應用面。本課程所結合的專題會以該次任課老師的專長領域，亦或是所能帶來的外部資源，融入到專題的主題方向，使學生能夠在教師專業或外部鏈結下學習能應用於專案的知識與技術，並透過專案的執行歷程產出更為真實的學習成果。",
    "describe_eh": "This course focuses on the Project-based Learning(PBL) to engage students in the practice of project process. The course topic is derived from the teacher’s profession or the external resources. Students can develop their knowledge and technic according to the resources from the teacher. In addition, the outcomes also become more practical due to the real project.",
